==Strategy==
Le'saint has 1.8 million health and does 36k damage every hit. With Lord Enma, Sleipnirs and Shy Boys helping as support, getting a hit on Le'Saint without the use of [[:Category:Long Distance Cats|Long Distance units]] will be excruciating as the Sleipnirs' knockback ability helps the other enemies push. If your [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]] is not at least lvl 45 (57 if you lack [[Fruit Treasures]]) to tank at least 4 hits from Le'saint, this stage will be extremely difficult, if not impossible without other meatshields and a high amount of [[:Category:Area Attack Cats|Area Attackers]]. If you do not bring the appropriate units, you'll have to face both Sleipnirs, Lord Enma, and Le'saint all at once, and Le'saint will have to die first before any of the others can be damaged.

